to even try to replicate.

00:02:51.277 --> 00:02:54.235
'cause whenever I try
to sound like my fiance,

00:02:54.235 --> 00:02:56.794
I either go Russian or like...

00:02:56.794 --> 00:02:58.252
He's like, "I'm not Russian."

00:02:58.252 --> 00:03:00.188
I was like, "I know, but
that's like how it comes out."

00:03:00.188 --> 00:03:01.021
So, yeah. (laughs)

00:03:01.021 --> 00:03:02.355
- I can't do accents either.

00:03:02.355 --> 00:03:03.188
- I'm terrible.

00:03:03.188 --> 00:03:04.816
