00:03:06.482 --> 00:03:07.315
It's so sad.

00:03:07.315 --> 00:03:08.336
I'm not Meryl Streep.

00:03:08.336 --> 00:03:09.816
You know, she could just
like float through it. Yeah.

00:03:09.816 --> 00:03:10.649
- Oh, yeah.
- Yeah.

00:03:10.649 --> 00:03:12.374
- Anyway. So, you're getting
married in Scotland, right?

00:03:12.374 --> 00:03:13.207
Yes.

00:03:13.207 --> 00:03:14.125
- Which is beautiful.

00:03:14.125 --> 00:03:15.083
- We're very excited.

00:03:15.083 --> 00:03:17.254
We just secured the venue
yesterday, actually.

00:03:17.254 --> 00:03:18.087
- Oh, wow.

00:03:18.087 --> 00:03:19.848
- So, yeah. Next summer.

00:03:19.848 --> 00:03:21.681
- That's amazing.

00:03:21.681 --> 00:03:23.256
Is your family gonna make the trip?

00:03:23.256 --> 00:03:24.536
Obviously, his family's there probably.

00:03:24.536 --> 00:03:25.874
- It's gonna be very small, but yes.

00:03:25.874 --> 00:03:27.928
Like about 40 of us that are...

00:03:27.928 --> 00:03:28.886
- That's kind of the greatest thing

00:03:28.886 --> 00:03:29.888
about a destination wedding

00:03:29.888 --> 00:03:32.168
